{"parentUuid":"374f2086-7b48-4672-bc0f-727a93f9dac7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgwu4Ngv3cmKVmvxXc7BR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013Tjb3nEWu2iR4SRfu66xoq","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='PLAN.md'; s=open(p).read()\nfor a,b in [('''- Exit, live: Costs and Audit Log show `local` and a second server\n  together.\n''','''- Exit, live: Costs and Audit Log show `local` and a second server\n  together.\n\nDone 2026-11-11. The Audit Log is its own page now; Constraints still reads\none server's audit for each constraint's history. Live: with `two` added,\nCosts showed both servers' totals, a workspace named with its server, and\nthe days added up; the Audit Log showed both chains verified and their\nentries in one list. An export writes on one server, so it waits for one.\nThe run found that opening a records page read only one server, because\nthe page read under the route it left; that is fixed.\n'''),('''## After this plan\n\n- A model per step, chosen in the workflow editor.''','''## After this plan\n\n- A step is named `workflow/step`, and constraints and capabilities apply\n  per workflow step, not per kind of step. This changes D42 and the gate.\n- A model per step, chosen in the workflow editor.''')]:\n    assert s.count(a)==1,a[:50]; s=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncargo fmt --all -- --check && scripts/check-seams.sh | tail -1 && CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0 cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings 2>&1 | grep -E \"^error\" -A6 | head; CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0 cargo test --workspace 2>&1 | grep -E \"test result|FAILED\" | grep -v \"ok. 0 passed\"; git add PLAN.md crates/bastion-desktop","description":"Record U2, run CI steps, stage","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3202,"cache_read_inpu